license: MIT
version: 2.0.1
date-released: "2026-11-27"
keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - Sentinel-2
  - swissEO
  - point spread function
  - pixel purity
  - grassland
  - drought
  - mowing detection
  - Switzerland
